WEBVTT

00:09:59.561 --> 00:10:03.124
but they're still just fictional stories
that we've invented.

00:10:03.664 --> 00:10:06.184
The same is true of the political field.

00:10:06.565 --> 00:10:12.935
The most important factors
in modern politics are states and nations.

00:10:13.333 --> 00:10:15.133
But what are states and nations?

00:10:15.593 --> 00:10:17.718
They are not an objective reality.

00:10:17.742 --> 00:10:20.455
A mountain is an objective reality.

00:10:20.479 --> 00:10:23.763
You can see it, you can touch it,
you can even smell it.

00:10:24.223 --> 00:10:25.995
But a nation or a state,

00:10:26.019 --> 00:10:29.799
like Israel or Iran or France or Germany,

00:10:29.823 --> 00:10:32.563
this is just a story that we've invented